<div <%= test_selector("proxy-header-settings") %>>
  <%= render Primer::Beta::Subhead.new(spacious: true) do |component| %>
    <% component.with_heading(tag: :h2, display: :flex, align_items: :center) do %>Enterprise access restrictions<% end %>
  <% end %>
  <div class="saml-settings-form">
    <p>
      Proxy Header: <code><%= view.proxy_header_value %></code>
    </p>
    <p class="note color-fg-muted">
      Your enterprise can enforce enterprise access restrictions using your network proxy. Using your network proxy, inject the header shown above into every request to *.github.com/*. In addition, ensure that port 22 (SSH) is blocked on your network. For more details, contact your account manager.
    </p>
  </div>
</div>
